1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,920
Every meal, every coffee, every stressful hour leaves a trace

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:04,910
in your pulse.

3
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:06,470
Most of us never see it.

4
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:09,360
Meet Agni-Pulse. All you need is your phone.

5
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,200
Rest a fingertip on the camera.

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,920
The torch lights the skin, and the camera reads the tiny

7
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:19,360
colour change of every heartbeat, sixty times a second.

8
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:21,610
First, it checks the recording itself:

9
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:24,390
frame timing, steadiness and signal quality.

10
00:00:24,390 --> 00:00:27,210
If a scan isn't clean, it asks you to try again.

11
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:30,980
Then it builds the acceleration waveform and finds the a and b

12
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:34,570
waves, giving you heart rate, heart-rate variability, and b

13
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:37,130
over a, a marker of arterial stiffness.

14
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:39,300
Scan at rest to set your baseline.

15
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,840
After dinner, heart-rate variability halved, so Agni-Pulse

16
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,920
suggested a short breathing reset.

17
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:48,010
After a walk, the next scan showed full recovery.

18
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:53,150
Over time, it learns your normal, ranks the meals that suit

19
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:55,770
you, and shows which habits really help.

20
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:00,820
Under the hood: a native camera module, a FastAPI signal

21
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:03,460
engine and a secure cloud database.

22
00:01:03,460 --> 00:01:07,560
Tested by 165 automated checks, and on a real phone.

23
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:09,220
Agni-Pulse. Know your normal.

24
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:10,710
See what changes it.

